  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing support for service delivery to women and girls subjected to violence in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Perceptions of, attitudes to and behaviours on gender equality change at community and individual levels in the project areas, aiming at prevention of violence against women and girls. Enhance the engagement of young men in promoting positive masculinity and building healthy and equal relationships without using VAWG, Women and girls who experience violence use available, accessible, acceptable, and quality essential services, Legislative and policy frameworks on GBV, DVP are strengthened. Develop and finalize evidence-based policy papers on multi-sectoral coordination in the replication and provision of high-quality OSSCs for VAWG survivors</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide a safe and nonviolent environment for women and girls in Viet Nam especially women and girls severely affected by the coronavirus disease 2019 COVID19 pandemic, to achieve the targets of the National Program on Prevention and Response to gender based violence 2021-2025 of the Viet Nams Government the targets of the Viet Nam Strategy on Gender Equality 2021-2030 and the Sustainable Development Goals SDGs by 2030&#xbca0;&#xd2b8;&#xb0a8; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xd3ed;&#xb825; &#xd53c;&#xd574;&#xc790; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; &#xccb4;&#xacc4;&#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xd655;&#xc0b0;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xacfc; &#xc5ec;&#xc544;&#xc5d0;&#xac8c; &#xc548;&#xc804;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xbe44;&#xd3ed;&#xb825;&#xc801;&#xc778; &#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xc81c;&#xacf5;</narrative>
  </description>
